    {
      "id": "slice6-s6-regime-subheader",
      "file": "paper/source/chapters/13_s04b_joint_quantiles.tex",
      "locator": "line 24, Table tab:s04b-joint-quantiles",
      "finding": "The S6 regime subheader identified S6 as magnitude-scaled broad/long immigrant, which is the S5 regime. Table tab:s04b-thinning defines S6 as the magnitude-scaled narrow/short total-attenuation law. The S4-S7 subheaders are now consistent with that table.",
